#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:6
msgid "Gigabit PoE Shield"
msgstr "Gigabit PoE Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Gigabit PoE Shield is a 10/100/1000 Mb/s Ethernet shield with 802.3af "
"Power-over-Ethernet for OpenMV Cams that have an on-board Ethernet PHY. One "
"cable to a PoE switch carries both power and the network link."
msgstr ""
"Gigabit PoE Shield är ett 10/100/1000 Mb/s Ethernet-shield med 802.3af "
"Power-over-Ethernet för OpenMV Cams som har en inbyggd Ethernet-PHY. En enda"
" kabel till en PoE-switch bär både ström och nätverkslänken."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `Gigabit PoE Shield product"
" page <https://openmv.io/products/gigabit-poe-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"För fullständigt datablad, foton och beställning, se `produktsidan för "
"Gigabit PoE Shield <https://openmv.io/products/gigabit-poe-shield>`_\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:16
msgid "Supported only on the OpenMV Cam RT1062 and N6."
msgstr "Stöds endast på OpenMV Cam RT1062 och N6."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:19
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Höjdpunkter"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:21
msgid "10/100/1000 Mb/s Gigabit Ethernet with IEEE 802.3af PoE"
msgstr "10/100/1000 Mb/s Gigabit Ethernet med IEEE 802.3af PoE"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:22
msgid "Up to ~6 W to the camera via 5.6 V VIN"
msgstr "Upp till ~6 W till kameran via 5,6 V VIN"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:23
msgid ""
"1500 V isolated design — stacks with dual-header shields via on-board OR'ing"
" diode"
msgstr ""
"1500 V isolerad konstruktion — staplas med shields med dubbla kontaktlister "
"via inbyggd OR-diod"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:26
msgid "Pinout"
msgstr "Stiftutgång"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:28
msgid "Gigabit PoE Shield Pinout"
msgstr "Stiftutgång för Gigabit PoE Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:33
msgid "Pin reference"
msgstr "Stiftreferens"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/gigabit-poe-shield.rst:35
msgid ""
"10/100 Mb/s only uses the MDI TX and MDI RX pairs (Pairs A and B). Gigabit "
"(1000BASE-T) is bidirectional on all four pairs A/B/C/D, so the MDI TX ± and"
" MDI RX ± lines double as Pair A and Pair B at gigabit speeds, and Pairs C "
"and D carry the additional gigabit-only pairs."
msgstr ""
"10/100 Mb/s använder endast MDI TX- och MDI RX-paren (par A och B). Gigabit "
"(1000BASE-T) är dubbelriktad på alla fyra paren A/B/C/D, så MDI TX ±- och "
"MDI RX ±-linjerna fungerar dubbelt som par A och par B vid "
"gigabithastigheter, och par C och D bär de ytterligare gigabit-exklusiva "
"paren."

